sequenceDiagram
    participant C as Downstream Consumer
    participant API as Context API Contract
    participant CI as Context Intelligence
    
    C ->> API: Subscribe(ChannelID, FilterCriteria)
    API ->> CI: Initialize Channel listener
    CI -->> C: Initial Context Snapshot
    
    Note over CI: State Mutation event triggers update
    CI ->> API: Compile new Context payload
    API ->> C: Dispatched Event (ContextUpdated)
